   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8a50649a91baaba19f4a",
   "sourceHash": "8a50649a91baaba19f4a3c6043d6d3b5c73d15dd80562c6f47b4a6f9ec73d6cd",
   "text": "卓越传承",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f1c6db31ee1fd3d4ce25",
   "sourceHash": "f1c6db31ee1fd3d4ce2558ddecad0511593204424674b0d36285d405b39723a9",
   "text": "Proprietary Organics 系列隶属于知名的 Kairali Ayurvedic Group，承载着公司追求阿育吠陀卓越品质的传统。凭借数十年在健康与疗愈领域的专业积累，Kairali 在提供优质有机及阿育吠陀产品方面处于领先地位。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9306e40c81a45f6a1556",
   "sourceHash": "9306e40c81a45f6a155621f39ced186f5d814da5208266763eb00fa0a92b7143",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Proprietary Organics 不仅仅是产品，更提供了一条通往有效、可持续且天然的健康之路。这些专有配方植根于阿育吠陀传统，采用有机成分制成，可应对多种健康与美容方面的困扰。选择 Kairali 的有机系列，您便选择了一种整体的生活方式，并确保您通往和谐与健康的道路既有成效又安全。借助 Kairali Ayurvedic Proprietary Organics，汲取自然与阿育吠陀的力量，重新发现最本真的身心安适。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d76491e795b5fab875d3",
   "sourceHash": "d76491e795b5fab875d33beffeeabf52164ce47deb68d3db3656e396876a95d9",
   "text": "阿育吠陀膳食体验 | Kairali 的疗愈饮食",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4184aeb176456fd79737",
   "sourceHash": "4184aeb176456fd79737e812ff8917261a4255d7b4b166ed1357d2dbfc38c5c4",
   "text": "在 Kairali 疗愈村享用悦性（sattvic）阿育吠陀膳食：个性化、有机、均衡，有益身心。体验正念饮食与阿育吠陀烹饪。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_70d33f76d94996f988d5",
   "sourceHash": "70d33f76d94996f988d52da6aebd564d02fb3a8739c9dc7ac892dade1c690dc8",
   "text": "疗愈村的阿育吠陀餐厅与烹饪",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ec15347fb434a2a3aa6d",
